&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;This&amp;nbsp;project&amp;nbsp;was the first to&amp;nbsp;begin analysis&amp;nbsp;through&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW208254788 BCX0" href="https://www.doi.gov/pressreleases/secretary-burgum-joins-historic-effort-fix-americas-broken-permitting-system" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;modernized&amp;nbsp;Department of the Interior National Environmental Policy Act&amp;nbsp;review&amp;nbsp;process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;established&amp;nbsp;to meet&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW208254788 BCX0" href="https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2025/01/unleashing-american-energy/" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Executive Order 14154,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Unleashing American Energy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;State permitting for the&amp;nbsp;project&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;is being coordinated by the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW208254788 BCX0" href="https://www.oregon.gov/dogami/mlrr/Pages/chemicalprocess_Calico-GrassyMtn.aspx" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Oregon Department of Geology and Mineral Industries&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
